      "post_id": "34532",
      "author_handle": "orc30",
      "date_as_displayed": "Posted 18 years 11 months ago",
      "body": "Hi\nI just got back from 3 days working in Dublin.  Spent every night out on the town.  Atmosphere was amazing with lots of pubs with live music each night and clubs as well.\nIf you want a more peaceful time then head further south, from what I've heard",
